    <statement><p>Given that <m>f(3) = 3</m> and <m>f'(3) = -4</m>, approximate
<m>f(3.4)</m>.</p>
<p><m>f(3.4) \approx</m> <fillin characters="6" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>1.4</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><alert> Solution:</alert> 



Using the formula, <m>f(c + h) \approx f(c) + f'(c)\cdot h</m>,
<me>f(3.4) = f(3 + 0.4) \approx f(3) + f'(3)\cdot (0.4)
  = 3  - 4 \cdot (0.4) = 1.4.</me>


</solution>
